<title>CANADA: Rio Algom names new chief executive.</title>
<headline>Rio Algom names new chief executive.</headline>
<dateline>TORONTO 1997-05-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Rio Algom Ltd said on Friday it named Patrick James president and chief executive effective of the company June 2.</p>
<p>James was previously chairman, president and chief executive Santa Fe Pacific Gold Corp, Rio Algom said.</p>
<p>((Reuters Toronto Bureau (416) 941-8100))</p>
